---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import pages from "../data/pages.json";
---

<SiteLayout metadata={pages["/"]}>
  <main id="main" class="editorial-home">
    <div class="wrap">
      <section class="product-hero">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Otto by Tebra · Practice resources</div>
          <h1>Care for your practice, too.</h1>
          <p>
            Work through session rates, prepare a sample superbill, or explore
            how Otto drafts a note for your review. Free resources for
            independent mental health practices, with no signup needed.
          </p>
          <a class="button" href="/blog/">
            Explore the journal
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="art">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 640 500"
            preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <rect width="640" height="500" fill="#e0d3c8" />
            <circle cx="122" cy="116" r="160" fill="#f0eee8" />
            <path d="M0 385 640 275v225H0z" fill="#cbdde0" />
            <g transform="translate(167 96) rotate(6 150 150)">
              <rect
                x="13"
                y="14"
                width="310"
                height="285"
                rx="15"
                fill="#004852"
                opacity=".12"
              />
              <rect width="310" height="285" rx="15" fill="#f6f3eb" />
              <path
                d="M0 15a15 15 0 0 1 15-15h280a15 15 0 0 1 15 15v61H0z"
                fill="#004852"
              />
              <path
                d="M73-17v40m164-40v40"
                stroke="#8ca7a2"
                stroke-width="13"
                stroke-linecap="round"
              />
              <g fill="#cbdde0">
                <rect x="30" y="102" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="99" y="102" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="169" y="102" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="239" y="102" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="30" y="159" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="99" y="159" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="239" y="159" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="30" y="216" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="99" y="216" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="169" y="216" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                <rect x="239" y="216" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
              </g>
              <rect
                x="169"
                y="159"
                width="41"
                height="34"
                rx="5"
                fill="#b85c38"
              />
              <path
                d="m178 175 8 8 13-17"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#fff"
                stroke-width="3"
              />
            </g>
            <path
              d="m490 380 30-150"
              stroke="#b85c38"
              stroke-width="15"
              stroke-linecap="round"
            />
            <path d="m490 380-5 26 14-23" fill="#004852" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="product-section">
        <div data-b5-content>
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>Start with the work in front of you.</h2>
            <a class="text-link" href="/tools/">
              All free tools
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-grid">
            <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/session-rate-calculator/">
              <span class="tool-icon">
                <svg
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.3"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="2" />
                  <path d="M8 7h8M8 11h2m4 0h2M8 15h2m4 0h2M8 18h2m4 0h2" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <h3>Session rate calculator</h3>
              <p>Find a fee that supports your practice and your time.</p>
              <span class="small-link">
                Use free tool <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </span>
            </a>
            <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/superbill/">
              <span class="tool-icon">
                <svg
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.3"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14l-3-2-4 2-3-2-3 2V3Z" />
                  <path d="M9 8h5M9 12h7M9 16h5" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <h3>Superbill generator</h3>
              <p>Create an itemized document for out-of-network claims.</p>
              <span class="small-link">
                Use free tool <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </span>
            </a>
            <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/good-faith-estimate/">
              <span class="tool-icon">
                <svg
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.3"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2" />
                  <path d="M8 3v4m8-4v4M4 10h16m-12 5 3 3 5-5" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <h3>Good Faith Estimate</h3>
              <p>Prepare a clear estimate for self-pay care.</p>
              <span class="small-link">
                Use free tool <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </span>
            </a>
            <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/therapy-cost-estimator/">
              <span class="tool-icon">
                <svg
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.3"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                  <path d="M15 8c-5-3-8 4-3 4s2 7-3 4m3-11v14" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <h3>Therapy cost estimator</h3>
              <p>Explore client costs with out-of-network benefits.</p>
              <span class="small-link">
                Use free tool <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="product-section">
        <div data-b5-content>
          <h2>Let the visit move the work forward.</h2>
          <p class="access-copy">
            Otto turns session audio into a note draft and carries your signed
            note into proposed chart updates. Review the work and continue to
            cash billing. Its early focus is solo, self-pay mental health care.
            Watch the demo, then review <a href="/faq/#getting-started">access, setup, and
            support</a> before planning your first session. Signup on this site
            is a demo.
          </p>
          <div class="product-grid">
            <a class="panel" href="/mental-health-ehr/">
              <h3>A connected practice day</h3>
              <p>
                See how session context carries into documentation and payment.
              </p>
              <span class="text-link">See the platform </span>
            </a>
            <a class="panel" href="/ai-progress-notes/">
              <h3>A draft ready for your judgment</h3>
              <p>Start with the conversation on the page, then review, edit, and sign.</p>
              <span class="text-link">Explore documentation </span>
            </a>
            <a class="panel" href="/compare/otto-vs-simplepractice/">
              <h3>Choose with context</h3>
              <p>
                Compare the practice workflows and terms you need to evaluate.
              </p>
              <span class="text-link">Compare options </span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="product-section">
        <div data-b5-content>
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>From the journal.</h2>
            <a class="text-link" href="/blog/">
              All articles
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="article-grid">
            <article
              class="story-card"
              data-story
              data-category="Practice finances"
            >
              <a href="/blog/how-much-to-charge-for-therapy/">
                <div class="art">
                  <svg
                    viewBox="0 0 640 500"
