                        Superbill
                      </text>
                      <path
                        d="M28 80h229M28 126h100m-100 21h160M28 194h229M28 230h229M28 266h229M28 302h110"
                        stroke="#8ca7a2"
                        stroke-width="3"
                      />
                      <path
                        d="M28 105h50M28 173h78"
                        stroke="#004852"
                        stroke-width="4"
                      />
                    </g>
                    <circle cx="463" cy="342" r="53" fill="#b85c38" />
                    <path
                      d="m440 340 17 17 30-35"
                      fill="none"
                      stroke="#f6f3eb"
                      stroke-width="5"
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                    />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div data-b5-story-copy>
                  <span class="tag">Billing & paperwork</span>
                  <h3>A practical guide to superbills for therapy</h3>
                  <p>
                    What to include, what to check, and how to help clients
                    understand out-of-network reimbursement.
                  </p>
                  <div class="card-meta">
                    <span>Otto editorial</span>
                    <span>5 min read </span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
            </article>
            <article
              class="story-card"
              data-story
              data-category="Billing & paperwork"
            >
              <a href="/blog/good-faith-estimate-for-therapy/">
                <div class="art">
                  <svg
                    viewBox="0 0 640 500"
                    preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                  >
                    <rect width="640" height="500" fill="#e0d3c8" />
                    <circle cx="122" cy="116" r="160" fill="#f0eee8" />
                    <path d="M0 385 640 275v225H0z" fill="#cbdde0" />
                    <g transform="translate(167 96) rotate(6 150 150)">
                      <rect
                        x="13"
                        y="14"
                        width="310"
                        height="285"
                        rx="15"
                        fill="#004852"
                        opacity=".12"
                      />
                      <rect width="310" height="285" rx="15" fill="#f6f3eb" />
                      <path
                        d="M0 15a15 15 0 0 1 15-15h280a15 15 0 0 1 15 15v61H0z"
                        fill="#004852"
                      />
                      <path
                        d="M73-17v40m164-40v40"
                        stroke="#8ca7a2"
                        stroke-width="13"
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                      />
                      <g fill="#cbdde0">
                        <rect x="30" y="102" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="99" y="102" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="169" y="102" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="239" y="102" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="30" y="159" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="99" y="159" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="239" y="159" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="30" y="216" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="99" y="216" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="169" y="216" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                        <rect x="239" y="216" width="41" height="34" rx="5" />
                      </g>
                      <rect
                        x="169"
                        y="159"
                        width="41"
                        height="34"
                        rx="5"
                        fill="#b85c38"
                      />
                      <path
                        d="m178 175 8 8 13-17"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="#fff"
                        stroke-width="3"
                      />
                    </g>
                    <path
                      d="m490 380 30-150"
                      stroke="#b85c38"
                      stroke-width="15"
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                    />
                    <path d="m490 380-5 26 14-23" fill="#004852" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div data-b5-story-copy>
                  <span class="tag">Billing & paperwork</span>
                  <h3>Good Faith Estimates for therapy, explained</h3>
                  <p>
                    Give self-pay clients a clearer picture of expected charges,
                    with an itemized estimate and a repeatable workflow.
                  </p>
                  <div class="card-meta">
                    <span>Otto editorial</span>
                    <span>6 min read </span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
            </article>
            <article
              class="story-card"
              data-story
              data-category="Documentation"
            >
              <a href="/blog/soap-vs-dap-notes/">
                <div class="art">
                  <svg
                    viewBox="0 0 640 500"
                    preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                  >
                    <rect width="640" height="500" fill="#dce7de" />
                    <circle cx="490" cy="80" r="200" fill="#c5d7ce" />
                    <g transform="translate(165 55) rotate(-7 145 180)">
                      <rect
                        x="14"
                        y="16"
                        width="290"
                        height="350"
                        rx="14"
                        fill="#004852"
                        opacity=".1"
                      />
                      <rect width="290" height="350" rx="14" fill="#fffdf8" />
                      <path
                        d="M28 42h95"
                        stroke="#004852"
                        stroke-width="6"
